# Digital Input Tags Configuration

## Module: DI_16x24VDC (Address: 0)
| Tag Name | Address | Data Type | Description | Comment |
|----------|---------|-----------|-------------|---------|
| DI_Start_PB | %I0.0 | BOOL | Start push button | Main start button |
| DI_Stop_PB | %I0.1 | BOOL | Stop push button | Main stop button |
| DI_Emergency_Stop | %I0.2 | BOOL | Emergency stop | Safety emergency stop |
| DI_Limit_Switch_1 | %I0.3 | BOOL | Limit switch 1 | Forward limit |
| DI_Limit_Switch_2 | %I0.4 | BOOL | Limit switch 2 | Reverse limit |
| DI_Sensor_1 | %I0.5 | BOOL | Proximity sensor 1 | Position detection |
| DI_Sensor_2 | %I0.6 | BOOL | Proximity sensor 2 | Position detection |
| DI_Auto_Manual | %I0.7 | BOOL | Auto/Manual selector | Mode selection |

## Module: DI_16x24VDC (Address: 1)
| Tag Name | Address | Data Type | Description | Comment |
|----------|---------|-----------|-------------|---------|
| DI_Local_Remote | %I1.0 | BOOL | Local/Remote selector | Control location |
| DI_Reset_PB | %I1.1 | BOOL | Reset push button | Fault reset |
| DI_Maintenance_Req | %I1.2 | BOOL | Maintenance request | Maintenance mode |
| DI_Door_Switch | %I1.3 | BOOL | Door switch | Safety interlock |
| DI_Pressure_Switch | %I1.4 | BOOL | Pressure switch | High pressure |
| DI_Temperature_Switch | %I1.5 | BOOL | Temperature switch | High temperature |
| DI_Level_Switch_High | %I1.6 | BOOL | Level switch high | High level |
| DI_Level_Switch_Low | %I1.7 | BOOL | Level switch low | Low level |

## Tag Naming Conventions
- Digital inputs prefix: DI_
- Descriptive names following IEC 61131-3 standards
- Maximum tag name length: 24 characters
- Use underscores instead of spaces
- Avoid special characters except underscore

## Address Assignment
- Start address: %I0.0
- Bit addressing: %I0.0 - %I0.7 (8 bits per byte)
- Byte addressing: %IB0, %IB1, etc.
- Word addressing: %IW0, %IW2, etc.

## Access Rights
- Read-only from PLC program
- Accessible from HMI/SCADA
- Logged in alarm system
- Historical data retention: 30 days
